Summary: Lets resting bodies go to sleep, or keeps every body awake.

pWorld: A world handle from <b3WorldCreate>.

pFlag: True to turn it on, false to turn it off.

Description: Sleeping is on by default and is what makes a large resting
scene cheap.
*/
public handler b3WorldEnableSleeping(in pWorld as Integer, in pFlag as Boolean) returns nothing
   unsafe
