pWorld: A world handle from <b3WorldCreate>.

pValue: The speed in m/s, 0 or more.
*/
public handler b3WorldSetRestitutionThreshold(in pWorld as Integer, in pValue as Number) returns nothing
   unsafe
      _world_set_restitution_threshold(pWorld, pValue)
   end unsafe
end handler

/**
Summary: Returns the impact speed below which nothing bounces.

pWorld: A world handle from <b3WorldCreate>.

Returns: The speed in m/s.
