Summary: Moves a body to a position, keeping its rotation.

pBody: A body handle from <b3BodyCreate>.

pX: The x coordinate.

pY: The y coordinate.

pZ: The z coordinate.
*/
public handler b3BodySetPosition(in pBody as Integer, in pX as Number, in pY as Number, in pZ as Number) returns nothing
   unsafe
      _body_set_position(pBody, pX, pY, pZ)
   end unsafe
end handler

/**
Summary: Turns a body to a rotation, keeping its position.

pBody: A body handle from <b3BodyCreate>.

pQx: The x part of the rotation quaternion.

pQy: The y part of the rotation quaternion.

pQz: The z part of the rotation quaternion.

pQw: The w (scalar) part of the rotation quaternion.
*/
public handler b3BodySetRotation(in pBody as Integer, in pQx as Number, in pQy as Number, in pQz as Number, in pQw as Number) returns nothing
   unsafe
      _body_set_rotation(pBody, pQx, pQy, pQz, pQw)
   end unsafe
end handler

/**
Summary: Gives a body the velocity that will bring it to a position and
rotation.

pBody: A body handle from <b3BodyCreate>.

pX: The x coordinate.

pY: The y coordinate.

pZ: The z coordinate.

pQx: The x part of the rotation quaternion.

pQy: The y part of the rotation quaternion.

pQz: The z part of the rotation quaternion.

pQw: The w (scalar) part of the rotation quaternion.

pSeconds: How long the move should take, in seconds: the step time, for a
move finished next step.

pWake: True to wake the body if it is asleep.

Description: The way to drive a kinematic body (a lift, a moving platform):
it arrives by moving, so it carries and pushes what it meets.
*/
public handler b3BodySetTargetTransform(in pBody as Integer, in pX as Number, in pY as Number, in pZ as Number, in pQx as Number, in pQy as Number, in pQz as Number, in pQw as Number, in pSeconds as Number, in pWake as Boolean) returns nothing
   unsafe
      _body_set_target_transform(pBody, pX, pY, pZ, pQx, pQy, pQz, pQw, pSeconds, asInt(pWake))
   end unsafe
end handler

