pPy: The y of the point, in world coordinates.

pPz: The z of the point, in world coordinates.

pWake: True to wake the body if it is asleep.

Description: A force acts over time: apply it every step while it should
last. A force off the centre of mass also turns the body.
*/
public handler b3BodyApplyForce(in pBody as Integer, in pFx as Number, in pFy as Number, in pFz as Number, in pPx as Number, in pPy as Number, in pPz as Number, in pWake as Boolean) returns nothing
   unsafe
      _body_apply_force(pBody, pFx, pFy, pFz, pPx, pPy, pPz, asInt(pWake))
   end unsafe
end handler

